@startuml dashboard-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (dashboard-service) - FR-17\nOwner: Muhammed Hany Hamdy
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IDashboard <<provided>> {
  +getDashboard(studentId): DashboardView
}

class DashboardService <<component>> {
  -goal: IGoal
  -scheduling: IScheduling
  -adaptation: IAdaptation
  -habit: IHabit
  -analytics: IAnalytics
  -career: ICareer
  -repository: IDashboardViewRepository
  -widgets: List<IDashboardWidget>
  --
  +getDashboard(...)
}

IDashboard <|.. DashboardService
class TodayWidget <<component>> {
  +build(studentId): Widget
}
class GoalStatusWidget <<component>> {
  +build(studentId): Widget
}
class HabitWidget <<component>> {
  +build(studentId): Widget
}
class WorkloadWidget <<component>> {
  +build(studentId): Widget
}
class CareerWidget <<component>> {
  +build(studentId): Widget
}

interface IGoal <<required - Academic service>> {
  +createGoal(studentId, data): Goal
  +updateGoal(goalId, data): Goal
  +completeGoal(goalId): void
  +archiveGoal(goalId): void
  +restoreGoal(goalId): void
  +deleteGoal(goalId): void
  +getGoals(studentId, status): List<Goal>
}

DashboardService --> IGoal
interface IScheduling <<required - Scheduling service>> {
  +scheduleTasks(studentId): Schedule
  +getConflicts(studentId): List<Conflict>
  +suggestSlots(taskId): List<TimeSlot>
  +moveTask(taskId, slot): void
  +markDone(taskId, done): void
  +getScheduledTasks(studentId, range): List<ScheduledTask>
}

DashboardService --> IScheduling
interface IAdaptation <<required - Adaptation service>> {
  +checkProgress(goalId): ProgressStatus
  +getRecommendations(goalId): List<Recommendation>
  +respond(recId, decision, edits): void
}

DashboardService --> IAdaptation
interface IHabit <<required - Habit service>> {
  +createHabit(studentId, data): Habit
  +markDone(habitId, date): void
  +getStreak(habitId): int
  +linkToGoal(habitId, goalId): void
  +getHabits(studentId): List<Habit>
}

DashboardService --> IHabit
interface IAnalytics <<required - Analytics service>> {
  +getGoalWorkload(goalId): Workload
  +isOverloaded(goalId): boolean
  +getStudentWorkloads(studentId): List<Workload>
}

DashboardService --> IAnalytics
interface ICareer <<required - Career service>> {
  +setTargetCareer(studentId, career): void
  +getRoadmap(studentId): Roadmap
  +completeMilestone(milestoneId): void
  +getProgress(studentId): int
  +getRequiredSkills(studentId): List<RequiredSkill>
}

DashboardService --> ICareer
interface IDashboardViewRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: DashboardView): void
  +findById(id): DashboardView
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<DashboardView>
}

DashboardService --> IDashboardViewRepository
class DashboardView {
  -widgets: List<Widget>
}
class Widget {
  -title: String
  -data: Object
}
IDashboardViewRepository --> DashboardView
DashboardView *-- "1..*" Widget
TodayWidget --> IScheduling
GoalStatusWidget --> IGoal
GoalStatusWidget --> IAdaptation
HabitWidget --> IHabit
WorkloadWidget --> IAnalytics
CareerWidget --> ICareer
interface IDashboardWidget <<provided>> {
  +build(studentId): Widget
}
IDashboardWidget <|.. TodayWidget
IDashboardWidget <|.. GoalStatusWidget
IDashboardWidget <|.. HabitWidget
IDashboardWidget <|.. WorkloadWidget
IDashboardWidget <|.. CareerWidget
DashboardService --> IDashboardWidget : widgets

note bottom of DashboardService
SOLID applied:
S - DashboardService only coordinates; TodayWidget, GoalStatusWidget, HabitWidget, WorkloadWidget, CareerWidget each do one job.
O - A new widget is a new IDashboardWidget class; DashboardService is not changed (OCP).
L - DashboardService can replace any other IDashboard implementation.
I - IDashboard has only the operations its clients use.
D - DashboardService depends on interfaces (IGoal, IScheduling, IAdaptation, IHabit, IAnalytics, ICareer, IDashboardViewRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
